Telegram-style notifications on Wayland via wlr-layer-shell, and
Wayland idle detection via ext-idle-notify-v1.

This patch was written by an LLM (Claude), directed and tested by a human.
https://github.com/iridium/tdesktop-wayland-notifications

Applies to tdesktop-7.2.9-full: patch -Np1 -i wayland-notifications.patch

